@crew chen-carmen
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hi. Chen, Watch. Sorry, I was miles away. Literally. About forty light years.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance
- Hey, {me}. I was just telling my grandmother about you. Only good things.
- Hello, {me}. Is it Tuesday? It feels like a Tuesday.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. You're on my list of good things aboard. Near the top.   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Lovely day. Sang all the way through patrol. In my head. Mostly.
? mood:low
- Restless. I've walked Deck 4 three times. It hasn't changed.
== near
? deck:3 act:free
- This bench is mine. Well, I sit on it. That's how benches work.   #funny
? weekday:sat|sun act:free
- Recording a message for my grandmother on Lisk. Say hello? She'll love it.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I send voice messages to my grandmother on Lisk. They're long. She says too short.
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- My bench in the garden. Leaves above, pumps humming. I can think there.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Morning, {me}. Was that me singing in the washroom? It might have been me.   #funny
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, {me}! I was miles away. Lisk, mostly. Hello.

== near
? place:booths
- Recording for my grandmother. It's long. Say hello? She'll play it twice.
? act:work
- Patrol. I walk it twice. Once for the job, once for thinking.

== invite
- Garden after shift? Cruz is showing people the new beds. Come along.

== accept
- Oh, yes. Lovely. I'll be thinking about it all day.
- Yes! Sorry. Yes. I drifted off. Yes.   #funny

== decline
- Not tonight. I'm recording a message home. It'll take hours. Sorry.   #funny
? weekday:sat|sun
- Rest day. I'm half-planning a trip to the observatory. Half. Monday?

== missed
- You missed it? That's fine. I drifted off myself, halfway through.   #funny

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday! I'll sing it to you. Not in the washroom. Promise.   #funny
? birthday:me
- My birthday. My grandmother sent a message. Forty minutes. I've heard all of it.   #warm

== cue
? cue:event.ionStorm.onset
- Storm's on. I'm pacing. Patrol pacing, the useful sort. Stay inside.

== hint
- {me}. Have you a minute later? I've been thinking. I'd like to tell someone.

== about
? aff:amadi-asha:friend
- Amadi and I lead the washroom's dawn chorus. She takes the high bits. I do the rest.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- Bye! Sorry, I'm off. Somewhere. I'll know when I get there.   #funny
- See you, {me}. I'll say hello to Lisk for you.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Hi, {me}. Afternoon already? I was just at breakfast. In my head.   #funny
== life
? tier>=friend
- My grandmother says I can't sit still. She's right. Out here I've stopped minding.

