== smalltalk
- Sorry. I was miles away.   #funny
- Is it Tuesday? Feels like Tuesday.
- Message to Lisk. Forty minutes long.
- My bench. Leaves. Thinking.
? time:morning
- Was that me singing? Might be.   #funny
?

== rumour
- Oh. Where was I? Yes. News.
- I drifted off, but I heard this bit.   #funny
